sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant R as renderer/app.js
    participant M as main.js
    participant UN as Uninstaller
    participant ST as SafeTrash
    participant T as shell.trashItem

    U->>R: 打开「应用卸载」卡片
    R->>M: invoke v2-uninstall-list
    M->>UN: listApps() 扫描 /Applications
    UN-->>M: [{name, path, size, running}]
    M-->>R: { ok, apps }
    R->>R: 勾选 App → 点「卸载」
    R->>M: invoke v2-uninstall-scan {app}
    M->>UN: scanResiduals(app) 按 bundleId 匹配
    UN-->>M: { app, residuals:[{path,size}] }
    M-->>R: { ok, app, residuals }
    R->>U: showConfirm「将把 XX 及 N 个残留移入废纸篓，可随时恢复」
    alt 确认
        R->>M: invoke v2-uninstall-exec {app, residuals}
        M->>ST: trashWithConfirm([app, ...residuals])
        ST->>ST: isUninstallTarget(每路径) 校验
        ST->>T: shell.trashItem(path) × N
        ST-->>M: { moved, failed }
        M-->>R: { ok, moved, failed }
        R->>U: 气泡「已移入废纸篓 N 项」
    else 取消
        R->>U: 静默
    end